  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Shv Shankar Sahu vs State Of U.P. on 20 March, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:50953 Court No. - 52 Case :- Matters Under Article 227 No. - 2427 of 2024 Petitioner :- Shv Shankar Sahu Respondent :- State of U.P. Counsel for Petitioner :- Abhay Raj Yadav,Neeraj Pandey,Shilpa Singh Sikarwar",
    "facts": "The instant writ petition has been filed for following relief: \" i) Issue an appropriate direction to the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Prayagraj to decide the prayer for the interim relief in the Food Safety Appeal No. 52 of 2021 (Shiv Shankar Sahu Versus State of U.P.) at the earliest, preponing the date already fixed in the said appeal.\" 3.",
    "arguments": "Contention of the learned counsel for the petitioner is that an application for interim relief in the appeal filed by the petitioner is pending. It is further submitted by learned counsel for the petitioner that opposite party has appeared before the court below."
  },
